# Weylus Setup Tasks

- [ ] Download and install Weylus to `~/.local/bin/weylus`
- [ ] Create `uinput` group and add the user to it
- [ ] Add `udev` rules for `uinput`
- [ ] Reload `udev` rules
- [ ] Verify Weylus installation
- [ ] Create walkthrough documentation for the user on how to create the virtual monitor
